  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can transform into an array of planar entities.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Planar Wild Shape<sup>UC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use wild shape to take the form of an animal, you can expend two additional daily uses of your wild shape class feature and 2 points of mythic power to add the half-celestial template or half-fiend template to your animal form. (Good druids must use the half-celestial template, while evil druids must use the half-fiend template.)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc14\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
